# needs input-edit.scm (the interactive prompt, Name= Joe): the mouse in a
# text input. A double click selects the word under the pointer (cut with
# M-x), a triple click the whole field, and the context menu of a right
# click pastes over it. Expected: "got: Smith / 42"
wait 5000
window Enter data
focus
# the clipboard of the test, whatever the system has: a paste of this
# text means that the cut did not reach the clipboard
clipboard Preloaded
key M-a
# Vue takes a text within 30 ms of a key delivered as a key for the text
# of that key, and drops it (SDL_EVENT_TEXT_INPUT in vue_gui.cpp)
wait 100
text Bob Smith Jr
wait 200
click 100 17
click 100 17 left 2
wait 300
snapshot im0
key M-x
wait 200
snapshot im1
click 80 17
click 80 17 left 2
click 80 17 left 3
wait 300
snapshot im2
click 80 17 right
wait 500
window Popup
snapshot im3
# Paste, after Undo, Redo, a separator, Cut and Copy (the order of Qt)
click 40 114
wait 300
window Enter data
snapshot im4
key Tab
wait 300
text 42
wait 300
key Return
wait 800
# the output, which run.sh checks
expect got: Smith / 42
